<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/SupportType/endOfSupport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "There is a defined end of support for the artifact from the supplier. This may also be referred to as end of life. There is a validUntilDate that can be used to signal when support ends for the artifact."@en .
